+- _stitch_block(): forced \n inside a block -> spaces (formulas, indices
+  no longer slice sentences into chunks); hyphenation joins without space;
+  whitespace collapse; protective spaces around math invariant glyphs
+  (∀ ∃ ∈ ⊂ ℝ ...) so they never glue to neighboring words.
+- _merge_paragraphs(): re-glues geometric blocks split by PyMuPDF when an
+  inline formula forces a new block (broken sentence + dangling line).
+- E2E verified on synthetic PDF with ∀x ∈ A mid-sentence: one monolithic
+  paragraph, zero raw newlines.
